/-!
# Structurality from `Equation3798` through a two-guard companion

Generated by `defwork/itautcell2.py`.  `Equation3798` is `x ◇ y = (z ◇ x) ◇ (w ◇ y)`.  Its guarded obligation
-- a bijection of a finite model commuting with `x □ y = if (M.op b a) = a then (M.op b b) else if (M.op a b) = b then (M.op a a) else (M.op b b)` is an automorphism of `◇` --
is `GuardAut2_pyx_x_pxy_y_pyy_pxx_pyy_Equation3798`, proved elsewhere.  That obligation names no target, so every
